e","value":"{0F10A556-D5E9-450F-A29D-AE700A5DE855}"},"upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/releases/download/v0.14.0/pdfcraft-0.14.0-windows-arm64.msi"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/blob/HEAD/LICENSE-MIT","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Learning Machines LLC","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PdfCraft contributors","description":"The PDF workbench; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Adobe Acrobat, rebuilt in pure Rust","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Tutorials","DocumentUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/tutorials"},{"DocumentLabel":"FAQ","DocumentUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/faq"}],"license":"MIT OR Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/blob/HEAD/LICENSE-MIT","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The PDF workbench; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Adobe Acrobat, rebuilt in pure Rust.\nRead, organize, combine, split and secure PDFs in a fast, native app, written in Rust from the ground up.\nPdfCraft renders PDFs with care for the details that make a page feel right: kerning and ligatures, right-to-left and complex scripts, vertical CJK, colour emoji, shadings, blend modes, soft masks and optional content.\nCombine files merges any number of PDFs into one. Each file gets a bookmark, with its own bookmarks nested underneath. Extract copies the pages you select into a new document. Split divides a document every n pages, or before the pages you choose.","name":"PdfCraft","packageUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/apps/pdfcraft","publisher":"Learning Machines LLC","publisherSupportUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/support","publisherUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/releases/tag/v0.14.0","tags":["annotate","annotation","comment","conversion","convert","ebook","edit","editor","ocr","pdf","read","reader","viewer"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"PDF 工作台；以纯 Rust 全新重写的开源 Adobe Acrobat 净室重实现","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"PDF 工作台；一个以纯 Rust 全新重写的开源 Adobe Acrobat 净室重实现。\n在快速的本地应用中读取、整理、合并、拆分和保护 PDF，从零开始用 Rust 编写。\nPdfCraft 的 PDF 渲染注重让页面看起来舒适的细节：字距与连字、从右到左及复杂文字、竖排 CJK、彩色 emoji、着色、混合模式、软蒙版和可选内容。\n合并文件可将任意数量的 PDF 合而为一，每个文件都会生成一个书签，其原有书签嵌套其下。提取可将所选页面复制为新文档。拆分可按每 n 页或在所选页面之前分割文档。","tags":["ocr","pdf","批注","查看器","标注","注释","电子书","编辑","编辑器","转换","阅读","阅读器"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/support","publisherUrl":"https://getartcraft.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-05","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft/releases/tag/v0.14.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"a4a78ef7dd5a1ec000e60392173b33bed55f7cbb","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.14.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.installer.yaml","sha256":"bf413a68934bdb4fe740eb01bbdea95a6af5a5b8ae92e63c8f6f4fa07505bc1b"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.14.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"18023a6c9c94faea765e56e57a7c2486037112ae9b45c98515a914bfd19f100b"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.14.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"75fd0b6d76c95231508968ce86ca6c8c47352a4da3b04a5c9bab31cee5f3349a"},{"path":"manifests/a/ArtCraft/PdfCraft/0.14.0/ArtCraft.PdfCraft.yaml","sha256":"46c225b8d1bedcb374282e1125ec6256dd6ea0c49457a8d10a2f82623151da33"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.14.0"}